    "title": "West of House sample world",
    "source": "original-projects/zork1/1dungeon.zil (hand-transcribed, stage 2.1)",
    "coverage": "sample",
    "notes": "Three fully transcribed rooms (WEST-OF-HOUSE, KITCHEN, LIVING-ROOM) chosen to exercise every exit variant: plain, blocked, conditional, conditional+else, door, and routine. Rooms/objects marked stub:true exist only so references resolve."
  },
